ADDITIONAL SECURITY AND CRYPTOGRAPHY NOTICE:

This software contains encryption and cryptographic technologies. In
accordance with applicable regulations, BiteSe Communications states:

1. All cryptographic implementations conform to NIST and IETF standards
2. Signal Protocol implementation follows Signal Protocol Specification v3
3. All key material is generated using cryptographically secure random sources
4. All communications are protected with end-to-end encryption
5. Perfect Forward Secrecy is guaranteed through Double Ratchet Algorithm

For security concerns or vulnerability reports, please contact:
security@bitese.com

